## 2. NOTIFICATION SYSTEM - Deep Dive

### Architecture: How Notifications Get Sent

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Event Trigger                          │
│  (Registration, Status Change, etc)     │
└──────────────┬──────────────────────────┘
               │
               ↓
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Event Listener (Spring Event)          │
│  Catches event in database transaction  │
└──────────────┬──────────────────────────┘
               │
               ↓
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Notification Service                   │
│  ├─ Format message                      │
│  ├─ Send Email (async)                  │
│  ├─ Save to Database                    │
│  └─ Broadcast via WebSocket (real-time) │
└──────────────┬──────────────────────────┘
               │
         ┌─────┴──────┬─────────┬──────────┐
         ↓            ↓         ↓          ↓
      Email        Database  WebSocket  Logger
    (External)    (History) (Real-time)
```

